{"text": "One day a stranger saw Smiley with the box and asked, What might it be that you have in the box. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It might be a parrot or a canary, but it is only a frog, Smiley answered carelessly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The stranger took the box, turned it this way and that, and looked at the frog carefully. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What is he good for, he asked, and Smiley said that he could outjump any frog in the county. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After a long look, the stranger said, I do not see any points about that frog that make him any better than any other frog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Maybe you do not, Smiley said, but I will bet forty dollars that he can outjump any frog in Calaveras County. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The stranger said sadly, I am only a stranger here, and I do not have a frog, but if I had a frog, I would bet you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That is all right, said Smiley, if you hold my box a minute, I will go and get you a frog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the stranger put up his forty dollars and sat down to wait while Smiley went to the swamp. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Left alone, the stranger took out Daniel Webster, opened his mouth, and filled him with quail shot almost up to his chin.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "a", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "n", "g", "e", "r", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "S", "m", "i", "l", "e", "y", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "x", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e", "d", ",", " ", "W", "h", "a", "t", " ", "m", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "b", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "x", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "m", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "b", "e", " ", "a", " ", "p", "a", "r", "r", "o", "t", " ", "o", "r", " ", "a",